name: sim.getExplicitHandling
description: Retrieves the explicit handling flags for a scene object
luaSynopsis: int explicitHandlingFlags = sim.getExplicitHandling(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int explicitHandlingFlags = sim.getExplicitHandling(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of a scene object
outputs:
1. explicitHandlingFlags: the explicit handling flags for the specified object (for now only bit 0 is used)
replacedBy:
- name: explicitHandling, class: proximitySensor, file: proximitySensor_explicitHandling.property
- name: explicitHandling, class: visionSensor, file: visionSensor_explicitHandling.property
